                                "sense_id": "f48f6794-aefa-35e8-b637-6c287305b05b",
                                "text": "Returning to our own epistemic situation, we do not know the sense in which quantum mechanics and relativity will be taken to be approximately true after their descriptive infelicities are addressed."
